\item{\code{mzlib_usage_error} (usage)}{mzLib's MapResidue refused a query's position as outside the source protein (ArgumentOutOfRangeException): 0, negative, or past its last residue. The message names the query and quotes mzLib, which gives the protein's length. The whole call fails on the first such query, in input order, and no row is returned. A source protein that is not kept is an outcome, SourceNotInAlignment, checked before the position.}
\item{\code{mzlib_bridge_error} (correctness)}{a file mzLib's reader refuses (InvalidDataException, naming file and line): in the alignment, a sequence line before any header, an empty header, a character that is not a letter, * or -, rows of different widths, an empty alignment, a kept protein twice, or an alignment whose kept proteins belong to two gene trees; in the gene-tree file, a row without four cells, a flag other than Y or N, or a kept gene in two trees or without exactly one canonical protein; a GTF gene row without gene_id}
\item{\code{mzlib_service_unavailable} (service_unavailable)}{Never raised by this verb.}
}
